<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT size=4>各班班主任：学生到达集合地点后进行人员清点，并上报年段长，由年段长向现场指挥进行汇报。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 16pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=4> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><STRONG><FONT size=4>（五）提前准备的事项：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></STRONG></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: -84pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 84pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: -7.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN>1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">．校长室：<SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold">组织相关处室、体育组设计筹划全校应急疏散线路安排，对所有参加演练的人员进行一次动员。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN>2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">．医务室：准备药水、纱布、盐水、胶带等药用品。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: -84pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 84pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: -7.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN>3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">．班主任：通知学生疏散线路、方向等各项要求。教育学生演练时要有秩序、有组织，一切行动听指挥；在走廊上、楼梯口不要拥挤，避免踩踏事件发生。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">．宣传组：①制作宣传标语；②负责相关的报道。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>5. </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">安全处：在演练前对现场进行一次安全检查，确保路线通过安全。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US><o:p><STRONG><FONT size=4> </FONT></STRONG></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><STRONG><FONT size=4>（六）疏散训练要求与注意事项：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></STRONG></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">、通过应急疏散演练达到安全教育的目的，各班级要在演练前对全体学生开展一次安全常识、自救、逃生知识的教育，使每个学生都掌握基本的安全知识。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">、所有参练人员必须服从指挥，个个参加，听从命令，不得擅自指挥或干扰指挥，确保每一位同学都要逃离危险区域，如有行动不便的学生要组织其他学生帮助逃离，或教师自己背着离开现场。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体" lang=EN-US>3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">、疏散演练过程要严肃进行，切勿哄堂大笑，保证达到预期效果。同时，又要注意演练中的安全，不追跑、拥挤、推搡，更不得喧哗、开玩笑；以防意外发生。如发现有人摔倒，应将其扶起，帮助一起逃离危险地。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P><FONT size=4><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA" lang=EN-US>4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA">、听到学校发出的指令后，全校师生立即快速、有序、安全地进行疏散，不能再收拾物品；严禁重返教室，以免影响疏散通道的畅通，教师必须让道给学生。</SPAN></FONT></P>
<P><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体">附<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>、应急疏散逃生路线图</SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090309492374.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090309492374.jpg" width=865 onload=resizepic(this) height=623> </A></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P></SPAN>
<P><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA">附2、应急联系电话</SPAN></P>
<P><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090309501030.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018090309501030.jpg" width=643 onload=resizepic(this) height=267></A></SPAN></P>
<P align=right><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 1.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA"><FONT size=4>安全处<BR>2018.9.3 </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></P>
    
